<section class="vb-itinerary-intelligence-wrap">
<div class="vb-itinerary-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Door-to-door timing</span><h2><?=e(date('l, F j',strtotime($date)))?></h2><p>Preparation buffers and transfer estimates are derived from saved trip facts. They do not represent live traffic, security-line or provider guarantees.</p></div><?php if($canPlan):?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="trip_id" value="<?=$tripId?>"><input type="hidden" name="date" value="<?=e($date)?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="apply_order"><button class="button secondary small" type="submit">Apply suggested flexible order</button></form><?php endif;?></div>
<div class="vb-itinerary-stats"><article><strong><?=(int)($snapshot['summary']['fixed']??0)?></strong><span>Fixed anchors</span></article><article><strong><?=(int)($snapshot['summary']['flexible']??0)?></strong><span>Flexible plans</span></article><article class="<?=((int)($snapshot['summary']['high_issues']??0)>0)?'danger':''?>"><strong><?=(int)($snapshot['summary']['high_issues']??0)?></strong><span>High conflicts</span></article><article><strong><?=(int)($snapshot['summary']['open_gaps']??0)?></strong><span>Open gaps</span></article></div>
